      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Delivery courier Álex drops by the PS Management office with a parcel for a neighbour and quietly asks Magüi how Paquita is coping. Before leaving, he asks an exasperated Paquita whether she has watched his cousin's showreel yet. Listen to the Spanish first.",
